{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12112290","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12112290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1211229001:1":{"text":"This place... That document. What does it say? What is the Dead Tide Fleet planning?","source_cn":"这地方……还有这张纸。上面写着什么？是死潮舰队的计划吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F3DC4773622042B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1211229001":{"text":"This place... That document. What does it say? What is the Dead Tide Fleet planning?","source_cn":"这地方……还有这张纸。上面写着什么？是死潮舰队的计划吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F3DC4773622042B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211229002:0":{"text":"Unfortunately, I'm not very familiar with these technical terms.","source_cn":"……词太难了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8440023491F561B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211229003:0":{"text":"According to what's written here, the researchers are trying to separate the soul of a creature and fuse it with other physical bodies.","source_cn":"看上面的记录，这里的研究员在尝试将某种生物的灵魂单独剥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA665CB645FC772D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211229004:0":{"text":"The Dead Tide Fleet has done this experiment many times with little success. However, a few have actually succeeded. The report says they need more specimens.","source_cn":"死潮舰队试验了很多很多次，大部分都失败了，只有极少数有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07F6EF5230DD249F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211229005:1":{"text":"More specimens...?","source_cn":"实验材料，是什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9419898AC58E87F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211229006:0":{"text":"Wait... do you mean the villagers?","source_cn":"是那些村庄里消失的人吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1993CCCDD87DFC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1211229006":{"text":"Wait... do you mean the villagers?","source_cn":"是那些村庄里消失的人吗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1993CCCDD87DFC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211229007:1":{"text":"The Carmine Whispers have sacrificed too much for me to turn away now.","source_cn":"血薇帮伴随牺牲一路走到今天，我不会移开目光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x054DB320D0225C28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211229008: